{"title": "Profoundly Intoxicated (Condition)", "pageid": 31340, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Profoundly_Intoxicated_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Has stack priority", "Has status properties", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alcohol Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Profoundly Intoxicated</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Thisobald is on the verge of passing out from his heavy drinking.</li>\n<li>He has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on Charisma and Dexterity <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Checks</a>, and his hallucinations continue. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">TWN_DISTILLERY_DRUNK_STATUS</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CTWN_DISTILLERY_DRUNK_STATUS%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CTWN_DISTILLERY_DRUNK_STATUS%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Drunk\" title=\"SG Drunk\">SG_Drunk</a>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" title=\"Stack priority\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/38px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/50px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stack priority\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack priority\">Stack priority</a>: 2\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/ForceOverhead\" title=\"Status properties/ForceOverhead\">ForceOverhead</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>TWN_DISTILLERY_DRUNK_STATUS</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Blacked_Out\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blacked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Blacked Out (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blacked Out\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Blacked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Blacked Out (Condition)\">Blacked Out</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Thisobald has overindulged in his own brew. He has a -5 penalty to <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> and is <a href=\"/wiki/Vulnerable\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vulnerable\">Vulnerable</a> to Slashing, Piercing, Bludgeoning and Thunder Damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Moderately_Inebriated\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moderately_Inebriated_(Condition)\" title=\"Moderately Inebriated (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Moderately Inebriated\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Moderately_Inebriated_(Condition)\" title=\"Moderately Inebriated (Condition)\">Moderately Inebriated</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Each sip of his special brew makes Thisobald more intoxicated.</li>\n<li>He has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on Charisma and Dexterity <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Checks</a>, and has started hallucinating imps.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Profoundly_Intoxicated\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Profoundly_Intoxicated_(Condition)\" title=\"Profoundly Intoxicated (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Profoundly Intoxicated\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Profoundly Intoxicated</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Thisobald is on the verge of passing out from his heavy drinking.</li>\n<li>He has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on Charisma and Dexterity <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Checks</a>, and his hallucinations continue.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714215406\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2273/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25559/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6318/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.030/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1259276/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   57.648      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   57.648      1 -total\n 42.51%   24.506      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 25.35%   14.616      8 Template:Icon_link\n 24.13%   13.908      8 Template:Icon_text\n 20.10%   11.587     24 Template:Trim\n 15.84%    9.129      1 Template:PageSeo\n 13.21%    7.617      3 Template:Template_style\n 12.67%    7.304      2 Template:Condition_sources\n  9.47%    5.459      3 Template:Condition_inline/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31340-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714215406 and revision id 342819. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div